    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_annie_q": {
        "skill": "[Add-on] Annie hurls a fireball that deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. A kill refunds half its cooldown.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Annie summons Tibbers onto an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him. Tibbers stays for <#ffb900ff>8s<> and can be killed: he chases and attacks enemies on his own for <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>7% Ability Power<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> a hit and burns enemies around him for <#a974ffff>7<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>4% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every second."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_annie_q": {
        "skill": "[확장] 불덩이를 던져 <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 65%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입힙니다. 대상을 처치하면 재사용 대기시간 절반을 돌려받습니다.",
        "ult": "[확장] 티버를 적 챔피언에게 떨어뜨려 주변 적에게 <#a974ffff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 70%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입힙니다. 티버는 <#ffb900ff>8초<> 동안 남아 스스로 적을 쫓아 공격해 한 번에 <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 7%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 입히고, 매초 주변 적을 불태워 <#a974ffff>7<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 4%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입힙니다. 처치될 수 있습니다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_annie_q": {
        "skill": "【拡張】火の玉を投げ、<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の65%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>を与える。倒すとCDが半分戻る。",
        "ult": "【拡張】ティバーズを敵チャンピオンに落とし、周囲の敵に<#a974ffff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>を与える。ティバーズは<#ffb900ff>8秒<>間場に残り、自ら敵を追い攻撃して1回ごとに<#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の7%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>、毎秒周囲の敵を燃やして<#a974ffff>7<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の4%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。倒されることもある。"
      }
    }
